   <indicator aggregation-status="1" ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tons of hazardous wastes that cannot be treated in the country have been exported and soundly treated.</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">8.1: Revision, improvement and submission for approval of the regulatory framework for the management of hazardous wastes. 

Additional (on top of the baseline) Metric Tonnes [MT] of e-waste collected and exported, Metric Tonnes [MT] of waste oil collected and recycled at national level, and Metric Tonnes [MT] of hazardous waste collected, stored and exported for disposal abroad (through the interim hazardous waste facility). 

Metric Tonnes of empty triple rinsed pesticide containers [Metric Tonnes] collected and recycled into products.</narrative>
    </description>
